==Battleground==
*1 [[Zory]] spawns after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Zackie Peng]] spawns after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Zigge]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Zomboe]] spawns.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**Infinite [[Zomboe]]s spawn, delay 10~40 seconds<sup>300f~1,200f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Zigge]]s spawn, delay 10~40 seconds<sup>300f~1,200f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Zackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 10~40 seconds<sup>300f~1,200f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Zory|Zories]] spawn, delay 10~40 seconds<sup>300f~1,200f</sup>.
**3 [[Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is very straightforward. Spam [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Giraffe Cats]] and the [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombies]] will dig under them, leaving the enemy base open to take damage.

